Create a project. The slug is its short name in URLs and --project. Name
defaults to the slug. Visibility defaults to the org setting; lease is a Go
duration between 1m and 24h (default 30m). Needs admin.

Examples:
  lorvik project create payments --name "Payments"
  lorvik project create secret --visibility private --lease 1h

Usage
  lorvik project create <slug> [flags]

Flags
      --description string   Description
  -h, --help                 help for create
      --lease string         Claim lease as a Go duration, 1m to 24h (default 30m)
      --name string          Display name (default: the slug)
      --visibility string    org or private (default from org settings)

Global flags
      --api-url string   Server URL (default: LORVIK_API_URL)
      --json             Output the raw API JSON
  -p, --project string   Project slug (default: LORVIK_PROJECT or .lorvik.toml)
  -Q, --quiet            Suppress the unread notice on stderr and an empty inbox
      --session string   Session label for this chat (default: LORVIK_SESSION or derived; see lorvik session)
